      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The Gamma4**™** series contain 3 nail types including",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Gamma4™ Trochanteric Nail (Short)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Gamma4™ Intermediate Nail",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Gamma4™ Long Nail (this topic)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Biomechanics",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**Long Nail**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The Gamma4 Long Nail is available in lengths from 240mm to 480mm (20mm increments).",
              "table": null,
              "images": [
                {
                  "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/423217/images/a16f4cb9-0d46-45c3-aeb7-f7f1cf39644a_screenshot_2025-01-14_at_4.20.04_pm.jpg",
                  "caption": ""
                }
              ],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "This nail has a 4º ML bend and 3º AP bend.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Diameter options include 9,10,11,12,13, and 15mm.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "It is offered in CCD Angles 120, 125, and 130 Degrees.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "The shaft has a length dependent radius of curvature. Therefore, this nail is side specific.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Shortened Proximal Body**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Proximal diameter of Ø15.5mm",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "The distance from the proximal tip of the nail to the Lag Screw has been reduced by 5mm compared to the legacy system. A bevel was added as well for less trochanteric protrusion.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Optional end caps available",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**A-P Bevel for Nail Insertion**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "AP bevel added to the distal tip of the nail to ease insertion into the canal.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Distal Locking**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Two static holes that accept Advanced Locking Screws, as well as standard Locking Screws",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "One oblong hole that accepts Locking Screws only",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Distal targeting offered",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Indications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The Gamma4 Long Nail is indicated for the treatment of stable and unstable fractures as well as for stabilization of bones and correction of bone deformities in the intracapsular, trochanteric, subtrochanteric and shaft regions of the femur (including osteoporotic and osteopenic bone).",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The RC Lag Screw is also indicated for rotationally unstable fractures. The RC lag screw is a combination between a standard lag screw and a blade, increasing the surface area of the lag screw by up to 2.4mm.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Approaches",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "It is acknowledged that several alternative approaches to certain elements of the procedure are available, and may have advantages for particular situations or surgeons.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
